#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "784"
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Salir"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "789"
msgid "Cancel the order."
msgstr "Cancelar el pedido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "807"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Pagar"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "813"
msgid "Order the currently selected item.  "
msgstr "Pedir el objeto actualmente seleccionado.  "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "850"
msgid "(I haven't picked anything.)  "
msgstr "(No he escogido nada)"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=dani64amv
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "881"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)  "
msgstr "(Me hace falta dinero)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "904"
msgid "Very well, that's %s."
msgstr "Muy bien, eso es %s."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "926"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(No puedo llevar más cosas)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "958"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Están agotados)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "978"
msgid "The strongest supplement on the market. Will fully\nrestore your health."
msgstr "El suplemento más fuerte del mercado. Recuperará\ncompletamente su salud."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1050"
msgid "Will fill your Heat to its maximum level. You'll be a\nwalking inferno!"
msgstr "Llenará tu Heat a su nivel máximo. ¡Serás un\ninfierno andante!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1121"
msgid "Will rejuvenate your body and soul. And it'll restore \nyour health and Heat to their maximum levels!"
msgstr "Rejuvenecerá tu cuerpo y alma. ¡Y restaurará \ntu salud y Heat a sus niveles máximos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1222"
msgid "These plastic shin guards provide light protection. \nThey're thin, so don't expect too much. "
msgstr "Estas espinilleras de plástico proporcionan una protección\nligera. Son delgadas, así que no esperes demasiado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1316"
msgid "This black belt is special, as they say the power of its \nlate judo master resides within. It should give you \nextra throwing strength."
msgstr "Este cinturón negro es especial, dicen que el poder de su \ndifunto maestro de judo reside dentro. Debería darte \nfuerza extra de lanzamiento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1452"
msgid "This unique weapon is designed to deliver burning\npain with deep cuts."
msgstr "Esta arma única está diseñada para hacer dolor abrasador con cortes profundos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1523"
msgid "This towel brings a sense of peace to its user, \nlowering their Heat."
msgstr "Esta toalla trae una sensación de paz a su usuario, \nreduciendo su Heat."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1593"
msgid "This unusual stone refracts light in a unique way. It's\nmeant to be a commemorative item."
msgstr "Esta inusual piedra refracta la luz de una manera única.\nEstá pensada para ser un objeto conmemorativo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1683"
msgid "These are steel shin guards. They'll help protect your\nlegs from attacks."
msgstr "Estas son espinilleras de acero. Te ayudarán a proteger\ntus piernas de ataques."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1757"
msgid "This ring increases your physical strength more and\nmore as you get injured."
msgstr "Este anillo aumenta tu fuerza física cada vez más a\nmedida que te lesionas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1834"
msgid "This is the Demon Stone, named for the hideous face\ncarved on it. They say it has something to do with a \ndeity who watches over travelers."
msgstr "Esta es la Piedra Demoníaca, llamada así por la horrible\ncara tallada en ella. Dicen que tiene algo que ver con una\ndeidad que vela por los viajeros."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1974"
msgid "A bloodied cloth that has seen plenty of action in the\nColiseum. Its original wearers have bled their souls\ninto it."
msgstr "Un paño ensangrentado que ha visto mucha acción en el\nColiseo. Sus portadores originales han sangrado sus almas en él."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2091"
msgid "A mysterious power residing in this thing somehow\nstrengthens left-handed attacks."
msgstr "Un poder misterioso que reside en esta cosa de alguna\nforma fortalece los ataques zurdos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2174"
msgid "These shoes will help muffle your steps. They're often\nworn by unsavory individuals to help them get out of\ntrouble."
msgstr "Estos zapatos te ayudarán a amortiguar tus pasos. A menudo son usado por individuos desagradables para ayudarlos a salir del problema."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2291"
msgid "These babies shield your entire fist. "
msgstr "Estos bebés protegen todo tu puño. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2330"
msgid "This thing is surprisingly effective as a hammer."
msgstr "Esta cosa es sorprendentemente efectiva como martillo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2380"
msgid "Put on this ring, and you'll have people coming at you\nin droves for a chance to defeat the Champ."
msgstr "Ponte este anillo, y tendrás gente viniendo hacia ti\nen masa por una oportunidad de derrotar al campeón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2479"
msgid "There's something I really don't like about this bloody\nbinding. Be careful when you use it..."
msgstr "Hay algo que realmente me disgusta de este sarashi\nsangriento. Ten cuidado al usarla..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2574"
msgid "Will have a healing effect if you stand calmly during \na fight."
msgstr "Tendrás un efecto curativo si te quedas calmado durante \nuna pelea."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2638"
msgid "This is a photo of an old and influential yakuza. They \nsay just carrying it will awaken the bloodlust of the \npeople around you. "
msgstr "Esta es una foto de un yakuza antiguo e influyente.\nDicen que solo llevarla despertará la sed de sangre\nde las personas que te rodean."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2769"
msgid "This ornate blade is etched with a beautiful and \nintricate carp pattern. Its craftsmanship is of the \nhighest quality."
msgstr "Esta Espada Ornamentada está grabada con un\nhermoso y detallado patrón de carpas. Su artesanía\nes de la más alta calidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2889"
msgid "Grab an enemy while wearing these to sap their \nstrength and charge your Heat up."
msgstr "Agarra a un enemigo mientras los usas para despejar\nsu fuerza y ​​cargar tu Heat."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2971"
msgid "This chain mail is said to confer upon its wearer the \nprotection of a divine dragon... or something. It's \nreally well-made, anyway."
msgstr "Se dice que esta cota de malla confiere a su portador la\nprotección de un dragón divino... o algo así. Está \nrealmente bien hecha, de todos modos."

